# ComplexModulusProduct: |z*w|=|z|*|w| over C, including zero.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/complex_modulus_product.lit
# Previously rejected, exact legacy-positive source:
# forall z,w C:
#     C_abs(z*w) = C_abs(z)*C_abs(w)
forall z,w C:
    C_abs(z*w) = C_abs(z)*C_abs(w)
# Boundary: additive formula or a changed factor fails in Rust regressions.
